      "message": "I think \"when accessory(E-Mark cable) is still attached,\"\nCC voltage is Ra -\u003e Cable det high (ANX3429 analog control) -\u003e TCPM enter normal mode -\u003e Nothing be found by TCPM -\u003e TCPM Clear Cable Det pin (0x41:bit7 \u003d 0)-\u003e go to low power mode -\u003e CC voltage is Ra -\u003e Cable det high (ANX3429 analog control) -\u003e TCPM enter normal mode -\u003e Nothing be found by TCPM -\u003e TCPM Clear Cable Det pin (0x41:bit7 \u003d 0) -\u003e go to low power mode -\u003e CC voltage is Ra-\u003e …\nWhen only E-mark cable is attached, EC will run as the above flow to wait for something (charger/docking ...).\n\nReason: under low power mode, if CC \u003dRa, Cable det pin shall be pulled high by ANX3429.",
